### Variables for Delete Achievement Tests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@jwtToken = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@validUserKey = ABC1234
@invalidUserKey = XYZ9999
@validAchievementKey = 8NctRKY
@nonExistentAchievementKey = MISSING
@otherUserAchievementKey = OTHER123

### AC1: Successful Achievement Deletion
# Tests: Valid JWT token, user owns achievement, achievement exists
# Expected: HTTP 200 OK with entity key response
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/achievement/{{validAchievementKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC2: Achievement Not Found (No Content Response)
# Tests: Valid user but achievement doesn't exist
# Expected: HTTP 204 No Content
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/achievement/{{nonExistentAchievementKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC3.1: Missing JWT Token
# Tests: Authentication failure - no JWT token provided
# Expected: HTTP 401 Unauthorized
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/achievement/{{validAchievementKey}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC3.2: Invalid or Expired JWT Token
# Tests: Authentication failure - invalid JWT token
# Expected: HTTP 401 Unauthorized
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/achievement/{{validAchievementKey}}
Authorization: Bearer INVALID_TOKEN_HERE
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC4: User Not Found
# Tests: Valid JWT but user doesn't exist in system
# Expected: HTTP 404 Not Found with correlation ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/achievement/{{validAchievementKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC5: Unauthorized Access (Not Owner)
# Tests: User doesn't own the achievement being deleted
# Expected: HTTP 401 Unauthorized with correlation ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/achievement/{{otherUserAchievementKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC - Test Cascade Deletion with Comments and Media
# Tests: Achievement with associated comments and media files
# Expected: HTTP 200 OK - all dependencies deleted in proper order
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/achievement/ACHIEVE_WITH_DEPENDENCIES
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC - Invalid Achievement Key Format (Too Short)
# Tests: Achievement key validation - less than 7 characters
# Expected: HTTP 400 Bad Request with validation error
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/achievement/SHORT
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC - Invalid Achievement Key Format (Too Long)
# Tests: Achievement key validation - more than 7 characters
# Expected: HTTP 400 Bad Request with validation error
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/achievement/TOOLONG123
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0